  "totalBlocks": 47,
  "translatedBlocks": 47,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d2019d3cc271d263",
      "translationZh": "AI 正在改变工作日的形态，而有效的实施会悄然减少工作量，从而显著节省时间。根据 Gartner 最近的一项研究，AI 每周为销售人员节省近五个小时。电子邮件往往是这种变化最先显现的地方。随着公司的团队和业务覆盖更多时区，电子邮件的规模也随之增长，人们最终可能将部分精力最充沛的时间花在梳理邮件会话、追踪待办事项以及重新拼凑上下文上，而 AI 能够更快地呈现这些信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f36b3b61d2e203c",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon Quick 自动化电子邮件工作流，帮助您重新获得可用于高效工作的时间。Amazon Quick 是一款生成式 AI 助手，能够连接您的业务数据并代表您执行操作。当您将 Quick 连接到 Outlook 时，它会总结冗长的邮件会话、结合相关上下文起草回复、安排会议，并启动下游工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b87e422bbf8b9dd",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们将带您完成端到端的集成设置，演示实际的自动化场景，并展示如何在整个组织内实现可衡量的时间节省。无论您是正在评估企业 AI 解决方案的 IT 领导者，还是正在构建工作流自动化的开发者，本文都会为您提供将 Outlook 连接到 Quick 所需的基础知识。有了这些知识，您就可以着手为团队重新赢回他们最宝贵的资源：时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbed125d836a5b7e",
      "translationZh": "完成此集成后，您就可以使用 Quick 中各项核心工具的功能，通过自动化重复性任务，并在您需要时呈现相关信息，减少处理电子邮件所需的时间：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e4a0cc780c0b76de",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon Quick 的一项功能 Amazon Quick chat agents，您可以创建自定义 AI 助手，无需离开收件箱即可根据上下文起草电子邮件回复，并总结冗长的邮件会话。这些助手还可以访问您组织的知识库、产品文档和内部维基。这有助于在保持质量和一致性的同时，减少起草回复所需的时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1bc77347903e19d",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon Quick Flows，您可以构建由 AI 驱动的工作流，自动化日常电子邮件任务，例如自动生成会议简报、从邮件会话中提取待办事项，或将客户咨询转交给合适的团队。通过自动生成的简报，团队有望节省会议准备时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7d7120a4f323972",
      "translationZh": "借助 Amazon Quick Automate，您可以编排跨越电子邮件、日历及其他企业系统的复杂多步骤流程。您可以通过单一自动化层，自动执行客户入驻流程、采购审批和跨部门协调，并通过端到端编排减少人工交接。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca5573292ed71374",
      "translationZh": "无论您是希望通过智能电子邮件辅助提升个人生产力，还是希望自动化整个组织的沟通工作流，本文都将为您提供所需的基础。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13d10c5bda5680be",
      "translationZh": "开始之前，请确认你具备以下条件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae62c8b306b2c878",
      "translationZh": "拥有 Microsoft Entra 管理中心的管理访问权限。Microsoft Entra 是 Microsoft 的身份和访问管理服务（前身为 Azure AD）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4a2389201989db00",
      "translationZh": "在你的 Microsoft 租户中拥有应用程序开发者（Application Developer）权限或更高权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "73a93ff3084dc54f",
      "translationZh": "拥有对你的 AWS 账户中 Amazon Quick 的访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25e94183fa09d5d8",
      "translationZh": "熟悉 OAuth 2.0 身份验证流程。OAuth 2.0 是行业标准协议，Quick 使用它代表你安全地访问 Outlook，而无需存储你的密码。你授予的是特定权限，例如读取电子邮件或管理日历，而不是共享凭据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2b9b56e387cac807",
      "translationZh": "此集成使用 Microsoft Graph API，通过 OAuth 2.0 身份验证将 Outlook 与 Amazon Quick 连接起来。完成以下步骤来配置你的 Outlook 连接器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f58439329b248e01",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：添加 Microsoft Outlook 连接器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ca9d64f358085b3",
      "translationZh": "在 Amazon Quick 导航菜单中，选择“连接应用和数据”（Connect apps and data），然后选择“连接器”（Connectors）。搜索 Outlook，然后选择“连接”（Connect）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e504dc93489fd73a",
      "translationZh": "图 1：在 Amazon Quick 中添加 Microsoft Outlook 连接器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "df3de5829c8340d7",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：授权集成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b397cb28233e5c2e",
      "translationZh": "图 2：使用你的 Outlook 账户登录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "589476f3669cdb12",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：授权 Amazon Quick 访问你的 Outlook 电子邮件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "936cf1990fa9d80a",
      "translationZh": "图 3：授权 Amazon Quick 访问 Outlook",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1f3ae0431b190f49",
      "translationZh": "步骤 4：检查连接状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c53e924923d62a88",
      "translationZh": "完成 Outlook 授权后，连接器会显示“已登录，就绪”状态。（可选）要测试连接，请选择“试用”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9680f70d560796bf",
      "translationZh": "图 4：确认连接状态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "858f38fdd2a3b2b6",
      "translationZh": "步骤 5（可选）：测试 Outlook 电子邮件操作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f57dc702b48019ba",
      "translationZh": "选择一个示例问题，例如查看电子邮件、撰写电子邮件或汇总日历事件。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcd977edfc2e0c0c",
      "translationZh": "图 5：使用示例问题测试 Outlook 电子邮件操作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "da1a852afe8bea4c",
      "translationZh": "用例与优势",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "adcef37071b80f4c",
      "translationZh": "将 Microsoft Outlook 集成到 Amazon Quick 后，您可以应对多个类别的沟通与工作流挑战。以下用例按 Quick 工具分组，每组均列出了客户可以预期获得的成效。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8e2e437453e42662",
      "translationZh": "Quick 聊天智能体用例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74e4e5d88ef43d5c",
      "translationZh": "客户支持电子邮件辅助：支持团队可以使用 Amazon Quick 聊天智能体，为客户咨询起草专业且风格一致的回复。聊天智能体会访问您的知识库、产品文档和以往案例的解决方案，从而建议符合上下文的回复。这有助于在保持质量标准的同时缩短平均响应时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c38f097e97b681ad",
      "translationZh": "高管沟通支持：高管助理和领导团队发现，聊天智能体在汇总冗长的电子邮件会话和识别关键待办事项方面很有价值。聊天智能体还可以根据不同受众，起草语气和正式程度恰当的沟通内容。这有助于减少高管花在电子邮件管理和往来通信上的时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26a88a113cbb69d3",
      "translationZh": "销售团队赋能：销售代表可以直接在 Outlook 中向聊天智能体提问，获取定价信息、竞争定位和客户历史记录。随后，他们可以将这些洞察融入与潜在客户的沟通中，而无需切换应用程序或在多个系统中搜索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b6d471c7208fdacf",
      "translationZh": "Quick Flows 用例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aa4408282be6fcc8",
      "translationZh": "自动生成会前简报：将 Quick Flows 配置为在预定会议前运行，自动提取相关电子邮件、文档和背景信息，汇总成简报并发送到你的收件箱。这可能有助于团队节省会议准备时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a66b65838dea7d4b",
      "translationZh": "生成每周状态报告：定时运行的流程可以汇总电子邮件通信、提取项目进展，并编制状态报告。这有助于减少每位团队成员手动编制报告所花费的时间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e5c988818289d84",
      "translationZh": "提取待办事项并创建任务：构建流程来监控收到的电子邮件，识别待办事项和承诺，并在 Asana 或 Monday.com 等项目管理工具中自动创建任务。通过自动跟踪任务，这有助于减少错过截止日期的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1860ef3cc2e57996",
      "translationZh": "Quick Automate 用例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5614b87ec9f9e4a",
      "translationZh": "客户启用流程编排：自动执行端到端的客户启用流程。当新客户签署合同后（通过电子邮件检测到），Quick Automate 会触发账户开通、安排启动会议、发送欢迎消息，并通知内部利益相关方。这有助于加快客户启用速度，同时减少人工协调中的错误。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f3abfde572169ae",
      "translationZh": "跨部门协调：编排跨越多个部门的复杂流程，例如需要在人力资源、IT、设施管理部门和招聘经理之间进行协调的员工入职流程。电子邮件既是通知渠道，也是后续工作流步骤的触发条件。通过自动化的跨部门协调，这有助于加快新员工入职准备工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c4752615d854897b",
      "translationZh": "在本文中，我们展示了如何将 Microsoft Outlook 与 Amazon Quick 集成。这项集成让电子邮件成为组织内更高效、更顺畅且有 AI 辅助的沟通渠道。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d4be1ef0e182c33",
      "translationZh": "完成这项集成后，您就为部署 Quick 聊天智能体奠定了基础，这些智能体可以提供智能电子邮件辅助，从起草回复到呈现相关知识。您还可以创建 Quick Flows，将日常电子邮件任务自动化，并将收件箱中的活动与更广泛的业务工作流连接起来。要编排复杂的多步骤操作，您可以构建 Quick Automate 流程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "697873dc3bbfed29",
      "translationZh": "要了解有关 Amazon Quick 的更多信息，请参阅以下资源：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4ec47eb930f4438a",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "465af32c8bc0aa87",
      "translationZh": "Amazon Quick 定价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c133d7d8476fb56a",
      "translationZh": "Quick 用户指南，其中包含语言支持及其他实用信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7a7ee0da35657dbc",
      "translationZh": "我们期待看到您如何使用 Outlook 集成来提高整个组织的生产力。欢迎在 AWS re:Post 社区分享您的实现方案和问题，并继续关注后续文章，了解更多 Quick 集成和自动化模式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
